{"id":54347,"date":"2026-07-22T08:20:50","date_gmt":"2026-07-22T07:20:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-dos-moinhos\/"},"modified":"2026-09-27T13:20:31","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T12:20:31","slug":"trail-dos-moinhos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-dos-moinhos\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail dos Moinhos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail dos Moinhos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail dos Moinhos 2026<\/strong> (7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) e o <strong>11\u00ba Caminhando<\/strong> realizam-se no domingo, <strong>27 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no lugar de Moinhos, freguesia de <strong>Fraz\u00e3o<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Pa\u00e7os de Ferreira<\/strong>, distrito do Porto. Promovido com dedica\u00e7\u00e3o pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa e Cultural de Moinhos<\/strong>, o evento convida os atletas a descobrir os encantos rurais da Capital do M\u00f3vel.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e chegada junto \u00e0 sede da associa\u00e7\u00e3o organizadora, o evento oferece as provas de <strong>Trail 17 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:00), <strong>Mini Trail 11 km<\/strong> (09:10) e uma <strong>Caminhada de 9 km<\/strong> (09:20). O percurso serpenteia por caminhos de terra, vales verdejantes, passagens por moinhos hist\u00f3ricos e conta ainda com a emblem\u00e1tica passagem pelo relvado do <strong>Est\u00e1dio Capital do M\u00f3vel<\/strong> do FC Pa\u00e7os de Ferreira.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com chip para as provas competitivas de trail, postos de abastecimento s\u00f3lido e l\u00edquido, seguro desportivo, lembran\u00e7a alusiva e o j\u00e1 habitual e saboroso <strong>almo\u00e7o volante<\/strong> final de conv\u00edvio para todos os participantes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<